<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 679.99 mln rand S.African bonds Friday.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 679.99 mln rand S.African bonds Friday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 679.99 million rand's worth of South African bonds last Friday after buying 198.10 million on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said. Markets were closed on Monday for the Freedom Day public holiday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
